    <bpmn:process id="W_W2189" name="W2189. Space Capital Investment Analysis" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual capital planning
Frequency: Annual; 10–20 renovation decisions
Volume: 10–20 analyses/year
Owner: FP&amp;A Director
Participants: FP&amp;A Dir, Store Design Mgr, COO, CFO
Source: workflow W2189 — Space Capital Investment Analysis</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2189_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2189_Lane1" name="FP&amp;A Director">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2189_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2189_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2189_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2189_End6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2189_Start3" name="Annual capital planning">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2189_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2189_Task4" name="FP&amp;A compiles the space-capital requests (a store expansion, a fixture…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: FP&amp;A compiles the space-capital requests (a store expansion, a fixture overhaul, a new-department build-out); calculates the ROI (projected sales uplift from the W2171 layout analysis, margin, payback period, NPV over 5 years); COO/CFO prioritize by ROI against the annual capex budget
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Director
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2–3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2189_Flow9</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2189_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2189_Task5" name="Post-renovation: tracks the actual vs. projected uplift for 12 months; feeds…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Post-renovation: tracks the actual vs. projected uplift for 12 months; feeds the learning into the future projection model so the space-capital estimates improve cycle-over-cycle
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Director
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2189_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2189_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2189_End6" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2189_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2189_Annotation7">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-396 (ensure controlled execution — Space Productivity &amp; Fixture Management (PA-55.3).) | - operational: capex-approval — the space-capital gate; operational: CFO sign-off on the ROI methodology and the prioritized list; CEO sign-off on any &gt;PHP 50M space-capital investment
Owner: FP&amp;A Director</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W2189_Assoc8" sourceRef="W2189_Annotation7" targetRef="W2189_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
